3. After HWE (reverse step 4): Aldehyde + phosphonate ester instead of conjugated diene/acid
4. After DIBAL-H (reverse step 3): Ester instead of aldehyde + alcohol
5. After TMS (reverse step 2): Need TMS-protected intermediate
6. After Still-Gennari (reverse step 1): Aldehyde + phosphonate alkyne

